FALSE-SHIFT INTERPRETATION

The frozen structural thresholds are already conservative enough
that the five-episode false shift does not produce damaging structural churn.

Therefore:

H143 does NOT demonstrate
a material hysteresis advantage
for false-shift safety.

It DOES demonstrate:
a major active-compute advantage
for hibernating candidate lanes
during largely stable conditions.

